@startuml
left to right direction
title Current prototype - use cases (2026 reconstruction)
actor Guest
actor "Service Manager" as Manager
actor "Department Agent" as Agent
actor Analyst
rectangle "Hotel guest service platform" {
 usecase "Register and submit request" as Intake
 usecase "View own request status" as Lookup
 usecase "Rate resolved service" as Rate
 usecase "Sign in as staff" as Login
 usecase "Filter and inspect requests" as Inspect
 usecase "Assign eligible employee" as Assign
 usecase "Change state / add note" as Update
 usecase "Review operational metrics" as Metrics
}
Guest --> Intake
Guest --> Lookup
Guest --> Rate
Manager --> Login
Agent --> Login
Analyst --> Login
Manager --> Inspect
Agent --> Inspect
Analyst --> Inspect
Manager --> Assign
Agent --> Assign
Manager --> Update
Agent --> Update
Manager --> Metrics
Agent --> Metrics
Analyst --> Metrics
note bottom of Inspect : Agent access is department-scoped.
Analyst is read-only.
@enduml
